            <title>[KYLIN-5645] add response params for model list api</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5645</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For api GET /kylin/api/models, if set lite=false, the response will not contain partition_column_in_dims and empty_model, which are expected by frontend.&lt;/p&gt;

